    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n725" root="است" body-key="A">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُسْتِىٌّ</span></b>  The <i>warp</i> of cloth; (K;) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُسْدِىٌّ</span>
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُزْدِىٌّ</span>: (TA:) but it is improperly mentioned
in this art.; for it is [originally <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُسْتُوىٌ</span>,] of the
measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُفْعُولٌ</span>. (K.)

